@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Admin rotate-season: disabled when TERMINA_ADMIN_KEY is not configured
# In the test/dev environment TERMINA_ADMIN_KEY is unset, so the endpoint is
# disabled and refuses the rotation (it is never accidentally open). A real
# deployment sets TERMINA_ADMIN_KEY and authenticates via the x-admin-key header.
# @name adminRotateSeasonNotConfigured
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rotate-season
Content-Type: application/json

{}

>>>
expect status 403
expect body.message contains "not configured"
<<<
